# Emoji :tada:

We shipped it :tada: and nobody was paged :+1:

- a time, 10:30:00, and a ratio, 1:100:1, are not shortcodes
- a name the table does not have, :not_an_emoji:, stays
- an escaped one, \:rocket:, stays too
- in code, `:rocket:`, nothing happens
- a typed one, 🎉, gets a label as well

[a link :rocket:](/steps) and <https://example.com/:rocket:>
